    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48195" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Theumēsus</span></b> , i,
		m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				mountain of Bœotia</i>, <i>near
			Thebes</i>, <i><span class="en">Stat. Th. 4, 372</span></i>. — Hence,
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Theumēsius</span></b> ,
				a, um, adj., <i>Theban</i>, amnis, i. e. Ismenus, <i><span class="en">Stat. Th. 8,
				462</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arva,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 2, 383</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">juvenis, i. e. Polynices,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 2, 331</span></i>
			.</div>
